(59, 'staff/2022/ced7', 'Mathematics', 'SS2A', '&lt;p&gt;QUADRATIC EQUATIONS(Word Problems)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ol&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;A girl is 6years younger than her brother. The product of their ages is 135. Find their ages. HINT: Let the girl\'s age be x,&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; brother\'s age be x+6. Note that age cannot be negative&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Twice a certain whole number is subtracted from 3 times the square of the number leaves 133. Find the number.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Harder Ones&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;The base of a triangle is 3cm longer than its corresponding height. If the area is 44centimeters square, find the length of the base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;', '9th January, 2023', NULL, '2023-01-02 10:24:05', ''),
(60, 'staff/2022/ced7', 'Chemistry', 'SS2A', '&lt;ol&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Define the rate of chemical change&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;List 6 types of chemical reactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;State 5 factors that affect the rate of chemical reactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;', '9th January, 2023', NULL, '2023-01-02 10:37:21', ''),
